# A Game Without Winners
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
You are letting me win.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
I am considering my strategy.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
Your strategy has lost four pieces in a row.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Perhaps I like your victorious expression.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Then earn it honestly.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
Her laugh interrupts the rain. For a while, neither of you listens for anything else.
